      <dl class="my-4 space-y-2">
      <dt class="font-semibold">Description</dt>
      <dd class="ml-6 text-muted-foreground"><p>diskEncryptionSet sets the cluster default storage class to encrypt volumes with a customer-managed encryption set, rather than the default platform-managed keys.</p></dd>
